maintain two separate masks.
Default the algorithm finds only one mask but it is possible to maintain two \
separate masks.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.7548970239521685`*^9, 3.7548970593877788`*^9}, {
  3.754996513752517*^9, 
